Subject: Onboarding pact: SDK bootstrapping, timeout/quotas & migration checklist

Hi Alex —

Great to meet last week. As discussed, I’m sending a compact onboarding packet to help your eng team stand up against our hosted endpoints and plan the endpoint migration window. Attached: a short onboarding checklist, SDK sample bundle, and a mutual action plan (MAP) draft for your procurement/ops review.

Top priorities for a smooth cutover:
- SDK bootstrapping: prefer our official SDK (see attached samples) for automatic retry/backoff and KV cache helpers.
- Timeouts: set a conservative client-level request timeout of 60s for initial testing; reduce to 20–30s for typical user-facing calls once batching/caching is in place.
- Retries: exponential backoff (base 500ms, max 8s), cap 3 attempts for idempotent requests. Avoid retrying non-idempotent generate calls without dedup token.
- Rate limits: start with a low concurrency cap (10 RPS) in sandbox; request quota increases via the MAP when you move to staging.
- Migration: a 2-hour cutover window with canary traffic (5–10%) for the first 30 minutes, then a stepped shift.

Quick SDK snippet (JS) — use the official package and set timeouts/retries explicitly:

const { RedwoodClient } = require('@redwood/inference');
const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.RW_API_KEY, timeoutMs: 60000, maxRetries: 3 });

try {
  const resp = await client.generate({ model: 'redwood-llama-7b', prompt: '…' });
  console.log(resp.output);
} catch (err) {
  // handle backoff/quota errors: 429 -> backoff; 503 -> retry gently; 401 -> auth check
}

If your infra will proxy requests through a gateway, please note our recommended headers for tracing and idempotency in the checklist.

Next steps: can your eng lead share a staging-ready contact + proposed 2-hour migration window? I’ll loop in our implementation lead to draft a concrete runbook.

Best,
Mina Haddad
Customer Success Manager
Redwood Inference

Attachments: onboarding-pact-checklist.pdf, sdk-samples-v2.zip, mutual-action-plan-saturnpay.xlsx
